{"id":"c143bbcb3765b2fa","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-separatorcone.md","title":"Positive combinations and interior of the separator region","display":"thm-separatorcone — Positive combinations and interior of the separator region","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-separatorcone","aliases":["27-thm-separatorcone"],"display":"thm-separatorcone — Positive combinations and interior of the separator region","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.2 Theorem 9.4","source_printed_pages":"409","source_pdf_pages":"433","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-explicit-positive-scaling","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-separatorcone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-separatorcone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separatorcone — Positive combinations and interior of the separator region"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Theorem 9.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"409"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"433"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked-explicit-positive-scaling"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,t),(w&#39;,t&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\">\\((w,t),(w&#39;,t&#39;)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\">\\(B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\)</span> 是下式定义在乘积空间中的开球，参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\">\\((w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(v,u)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\ \\middle|\\ \\sum_{i=1}^n(v_i-(w_0)_i)^2+(u-t_0)^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(v,u)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\ \\middle|\\ \\sum_{i=1}^n(v_i-(w_0)_i)^2+(u-t_0)^2&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left((\\alpha w_i+\\beta w&#39;_i)_{i\\in[n]},\\alpha t+\\beta t&#39;\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left((\\alpha w_i+\\beta w&#39;_i)_{i\\in[n]},\\alpha t+\\beta t&#39;\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sep}(f)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sep}(f)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.4，印刷 p.409／PDF p.433。假侧不等式相加仍非严格，真侧正组合仍严格。非恒定时把阈值移至最大假得分与最小真得分之间，有限条不等式获得正间隔，小扰动保持符号。常函数取零权、正或负阈值也有内点。原书称“full-dimensional convex cone”；此处明确只用正倍数，避免按包含零点的圆锥约定错误加入零结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$(w,t),(w',t')\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$。$B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)$ 是下式定义在乘积空间中的开球，参数为 $(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R$、$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"(w,t),(w',t')\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)","display":false},{"tex":"(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\coloneqq\\left\\{(v,u)\\in\\mathbb R^n\\times\\mathbb R\\ \\middle|\\ \\sum_{i=1}^n(v_i-(w_0)_i)^2+(u-t_0)^2<\\varepsilon^2\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\left((\\alpha w_i+\\beta w'_i)_{i\\in[n]},\\alpha t+\\beta t'\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists(w_0,t_0)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(B_\\varepsilon(w_0,t_0)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sep}(f)).","display":true}],"bytes":2019,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-separatorcone|thm-separatorcone — Positive combinations and interior of the separator region]]"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5"]}